The retrosynthesis route has 3 steps:
1. Step 1: Alkylation of protected 3-fluoroazetidine with bis-chloromethyl benzene
2. Step 2: N-alkylation of triazole carboxamide with the benzyl chloride intermediate
3. Step 3: Amide coupling between 3-methoxyaniline and the triazole carboxylic acid

